Rule 9 (A tensor's dimensions should be greater than zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 14 (Ensure v_1 and v_2 have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0
>>
Rule 15 (A and B tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0
>>
Rule 17 (A and B tensors should have compatible dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
